{"id":"vod_sn_35520","vodId":"35520","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士BLACK","name_cn":"假面骑士BLACK","date":"1987-01-01","year":"1987","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a55877786ff3695bef5cb474f40fa2c5.jpg"},"summary":"南光太郎和秋月信彦在一个日食的日子出生、并且以兄弟的身份被扶养长大。信彦的父亲，秋月总一郎是秘密组织戈鲁戈姆的成员之一。在光太郎和信彦19岁生日那天，两人被这个秘密组织捉去改造成为戈鲁戈姆的支配者·创世王的候补者·世纪王。世纪王·黑日必须和世纪王·影月进行赌上性命的战斗，胜者就可以成为新一任的世纪王。但是被改造成为黑日的光太郎在秋月总一郎的帮助下，成功在脑改造手术前逃脱出来。此后光太郎成为假面骑士Black，为了保护日本，救出信彦而与戈鲁戈姆对抗。但是信彦却在被救出之前就变成世纪王·影月，于是光太郎不得不与他唯一的亲友信彦进行宿命的战斗。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:35:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":52,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/rw6SXdXgie1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/Znwitu09QK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/fW2qgquvQF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/vNvWNiJfQQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/aU1VpkBxMf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/z6xN9DdbFn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/nc4HuEKgTr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/B15q1jDcyA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/WF3UNzvakt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/VfSS5yUdSH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/UmQC4rF2CC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/K6FhvnyunV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/xgk6EMJ6j01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/jtXg6QWAV61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url"